/P 619 0 R
/E (1. Not Taking Profits: It's crucial to remember that securing profits is an essential part of a successful investment strategy. Don't let excitement and unrealistic expectations cloud your judgment. Develop a plan to take profits at predetermined levels or milestones, and avoid becoming too emotionally attached to your investments.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 619 0 R
/E (2. Sending Coins to the Wrong Address: Before making any crypto transactions, always double-check the addresses involved. Crypto transactions are irreversible, and there is no customer service to assist with misplaced funds. Taking the time to verify addresses can save you from potentially losing your assets permanently.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 619 0 R
