/T (6. Buying All-Time Highs: Resist the urge to buy into the market when you see rapid price increases and significant market momentum. Instead of succumbing to FOMO \(fear of missing out\), consider employing a dollar-cost averaging strategy, especially if you're not an experienced investor. Crypto markets can experience drastic fluctuations, and a measured approach can help you avoid buying at peak prices.)
